    "sections": {
        "description": "A bilingual (English + Arabic) one-page personal site with a sidebar: your photo, name, section links, social profiles and Call / WhatsApp buttons stay beside the content while visitors read your introduction, services, work, experience and reviews. The sidebar sits on the left in English and on the right in Arabic. Set up in one screen: add your photo (cropped right there), name and links in Appearance → Customize → Your details, and the whole site follows. No forms, no menus to build."
